TEXT 784 80 Left 2 ;NOTE: All variables with "x" are computed values\nHere the flux is varied from 0 to fact*phiN from 0 to 0.3s\nfact maybe 1,2 or 3\nNow "x" parameters are computed for fact*PhiN (phi123x)\nvaried through a pwl voltage source\nBest to use:\nfact=1 mytime=1s .tran 1s\nfact=2 mytime=2s .tran 2s\nfact=3 mytime=3s .tran 3s\nNow time is related to phi-values\nof course you could also use time=0.1,0.2,0.3s
